      - text: — ◆ —
      - heading "The Perfumer's Covenant" [level=2] [ref=e62]
      - heading [level=3] [ref=e63]:
        - text: Four Pillars of
        - emphasis [ref=e64]: Trust
      - generic [ref=e65]: ✦
