    - generic [ref=e66]:
      - generic [ref=e67]:
        - generic [ref=e68]: I
        - generic [ref=e69]: Pillar
      - generic [ref=e73]:
        - generic [ref=e74]: ◆ The Freedom
        - heading "No Boundaries" [level=3] [ref=e75]
        - paragraph [ref=e76]: From a single gram for the curious student to metric tons for the established house — we serve the perfumer, not the order size. Every artisan deserves access to the finest materials, regardless of scale. This is our founding principle.
        - generic [ref=e77]: "\""
    - generic [ref=e78]:
      - generic [ref=e79]:
        - generic [ref=e80]: II
        - generic [ref=e81]: Pillar
      - generic [ref=e87]:
        - generic [ref=e88]: ◆ The Excellence
        - heading "The Finest Source" [level=3] [ref=e89]
        - paragraph [ref=e90]: We travel to the origin. Bergamot from Sicily. Oud from Siam. Rose from Grass. Each material is selected at its source, tested in our laboratory, and documented to pharmaceutical standards. First-grade, always.
        - generic [ref=e91]: "\""
    - generic [ref=e92]:
      - generic [ref=e93]:
        - generic [ref=e94]: III
        - generic [ref=e95]: Pillar
      - generic [ref=e99]:
        - generic [ref=e100]: ◆ The Promise
        - heading "Confidentiality" [level=3] [ref=e101]
        - paragraph [ref=e102]: In the world of perfumery, a formula is an artist's soul. Your business, and your product formulation details are confidential. We never share.
        - generic [ref=e103]: "\""
    - generic [ref=e104]:
      - generic [ref=e105]:
        - generic [ref=e106]: IV
        - generic [ref=e107]: Pillar
      - generic [ref=e111]:
        - generic [ref=e112]: ◆ The Partnership
        - heading "Partner, Not Competitor" [level=3] [ref=e113]
        - paragraph [ref=e114]: We do not sell finished fragrances. We empower you to create your own. Your success is our success, your brand is your own. We are the silent partner behind your masterpiece — providing tools, materials, and knowledge while you take center stage.
        - generic [ref=e115]: "\""
